<title>UK: John Lewis UK dept store sales up 4.0% last week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK dept store sales up 4.0% last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales rose 4.0 percent in the week to May 3 versus the same week last year.</p>
<p>In the 14 weeks to May 3 sales were up 9.1 percent compared with the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, were up 5.2 percent in the week to May 3 and rose 6.9 percent over the 14 week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
